{"seq":3,"slug":"the-congress-of-berlin","title":"柏林会议","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/otto-von-bismarck/major-events/the-congress-of-berlin","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-honest-broker","title":"诚实的掮客","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/otto-von-bismarck/major-events/the-congress-of-berlin/the-honest-broker","wordCount":1732,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"managing-the-great-powers","title":"驾驭列强","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/otto-von-bismarck/major-events/the-congress-of-berlin/managing-the-great-powers","wordCount":1753,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 柏林会议\n\n1878 年的柏林会议，是俾斯麦统一后外交的高峰。本章考察这一事件。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"诚实的掮客\"——他调停巴尔干危机、维护欧洲和平的努力。第二篇文档讲述\"驾驭列强\",呈现他纵横捭阖、维系大国均势、主导欧洲格局的外交艺术。\n"}